# Files EAS Build must not upload in the project archive. Without this the local
# pnpm content-addressable store (created by some pnpm operations in the tree)
# is packed into the archive, ballooning it to hundreds of MB. Nothing here is
# needed by the build.
.pnpm-store/
# Repo-root session state dirs hold live Unix sockets (nvim, pi agent) that break
# the upload copy ("Cannot copy a socket file"). .easignore overrides .gitignore,
# so this must be listed here even though .local is gitignored.
.local/
# Native projects are generated from app.json, never source-of-truth inputs.
/apps/agent-mobile/android/
/apps/agent-mobile/ios/
**/android/app/build/
**/android/build/
**/ios/build/
**/.gradle/
